<title>CHINA: Golden Island posts HK$73 mln year loss.</title>
<headline>Golden Island posts HK$73 mln year loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   45.5 loss  vs  4.0 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  60.72 loss vs  7.91 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    73.20 loss vs  6.33 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     219.64     vs  221.65</p>
<p>    Company name		 Golden Island (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Golden Island is a restaurant operator.</p>
<p>Exceptional loss is from provision losses from associated companies, long service payment, early termination of leasing agreement and writedown of fixed assets, loan receivable written off.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
